# Start here

New to this repo or this task? Read `docs/STATUS.md` first. It covers current status, environments, what is done, on staging, in flight, next, and the rules. Then read `AGENTS.md` and your lane contract in `docs/agents/`.

- One task, one lane, one PR into `main`.
- Never release or re-point the live DID +254709221536.
- No prod writes, secret rotation, migration rewrites, or merges to `main` without Alvin's explicit yes.
- Update `docs/STATUS.md` sections 5 to 8 when your PR changes what is live, on staging, or in flight.
